&lt;p&gt;
	We take food safety at Street Croft Farm very seriously, having achieved ratings of 5 since we started trading 8 years ago. During this inspection there were non-conformances with documentation which we have addressed along with all the other points raised in the report, we now engage an external consultancy to provide monitoring and support.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Due to the extreme heat this year we had issues with our fridges not holding temperature and although we managed this situation by de-stocking and re-freshing the stock in small amounts to allow for four hour rule we did not record this action on our existing record sheets. This has now been rectified to include a coloumn to record actions taken.&lt;/p&gt;
